    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARPEN YOUR SKATES...</h2><br>Help the adventurous polar explorer Siku build his new, snowy home in the middle of the a-maze-ing Puzzle Pole! Guide him through more than 200 levels and grab the snow brick in each one to make the perfect igloo!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... AND SHARPEN YOUR BRAIN!</h2><strong>How To Build Your Igloo</strong> takes a classic puzzle mechanic - the <i>slide forward until you can't</i> mechanic, as seen in many puzzle and adventure games - and makes it the core of a full puzzle game of its own!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A simple core mechanic:</strong> you slide until you hit a wall, or something else. Easy, right?<br></li><li> <strong>Five additional variants</strong> expanding the core mechanic from basic, labyrinthine levels to more complex grid-based logic puzzles with a touch of Sokoban.<br></li><li> <strong>250 handmade levels,</strong> carefully crafted with pencil and paper!<br></li><li> <strong>A puzzly overworld!</strong> Explore the Puzzle Pole, solve levels and clear the way towards your igloo. A handy map view is there to help you if you get lost.<br></li><li> <strong>Fun for everyone!</strong> With tutorial levels, a gentle difficulty curve and multiple puzzles available in the main areas, the game can be tackled from puzzle lovers of every kind. Stuck on a level? Try another one in the area, or try moving to a different area!<br></li><li> <strong>Fun for puzzle experts!</strong> Main levels are a piece of cake for you? The Puzzle Pole is worth its name... try reaching secondary, hard-to-reach areas to find more challenging puzzles!<br></li><li> <strong>Full controller support</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME <u>DOESN'T</u> FEATURE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time trials.</strong> No need to rush, it's just you and the puzzles.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer.</strong> But you can still ask your friends for help.<br></li><li><strong>Actual igloo building.</strong> That feature will come in the future. A DISTANT future. Maybe.<br></li><li><strong>Skins.</strong> Sorry, Fortnite fans.</li></ul><br>What are you still doing here, reading? Go fasten your ice skates and launch yourself into the adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARPEN YOUR SKATES...</h2><br>Help the adventurous polar explorer Siku build his new, snowy home in the middle of the a-maze-ing Puzzle Pole! Guide him through more than 200 levels and grab the snow brick in each one to make the perfect igloo!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... AND SHARPEN YOUR BRAIN!</h2><strong>How To Build Your Igloo</strong> takes a classic puzzle mechanic - the <i>slide forward until you can't</i> mechanic, as seen in many puzzle and adventure games - and makes it the core of a full puzzle game of its own!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>A simple core mechanic:</strong> you slide until you hit a wall, or something else. Easy, right?<br></li><li> <strong>Five additional variants</strong> expanding the core mechanic from basic, labyrinthine levels to more complex grid-based logic puzzles with a touch of Sokoban.<br></li><li> <strong>250 handmade levels,</strong> carefully crafted with pencil and paper!<br></li><li> <strong>A puzzly overworld!</strong> Explore the Puzzle Pole, solve levels and clear the way towards your igloo. A handy map view is there to help you if you get lost.<br></li><li> <strong>Fun for everyone!</strong> With tutorial levels, a gentle difficulty curve and multiple puzzles available in the main areas, the game can be tackled from puzzle lovers of every kind. Stuck on a level? Try another one in the area, or try moving to a different area!<br></li><li> <strong>Fun for puzzle experts!</strong> Main levels are a piece of cake for you? The Puzzle Pole is worth its name... try reaching secondary, hard-to-reach areas to find more challenging puzzles!<br></li><li> <strong>Full controller support</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE GAME <u>DOESN'T</u> FEATURE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Time trials.</strong> No need to rush, it's just you and the puzzles.<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer.</strong> But you can still ask your friends for help.<br></li><li><strong>Actual igloo building.</strong> That feature will come in the future. A DISTANT future. Maybe.<br></li><li><strong>Skins.</strong> Sorry, Fortnite fans.</li></ul><br>What are you still doing here, reading? Go fasten your ice skates and launch yourself into the adventure!",
    "short_description": "Skate your way in a grid-based arctic world and watch your new igloo grow as you help our friend Siku solve puzzles full of snow, creaks and ice cubes!",
